<html>
<style type="text/css">
    body {
        background: #ededed;
    }

    .container {
        margin: 10px auto;
        width: 600px;
    }

    /*-- Email CSS --*/

    .mexemeailtheme {
        background-color: #fff;
        font-family: Arial;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailhead {
        background-color: ##003a70;
        padding: 3px 5px 5px 5px;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeaillogo {
        padding-left: 35px;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeaillogo p {
        font-family: Arial;
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: 22px;
        color: #fff;
    }

    .mexemeaillogo p>sup {
        font-size: 15px;
    }

    .mexemeailphoto {
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailphoto img {
        max-width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailcontent {
        background-color: #fff;
        padding: 10px 30px;
        overflow: hidden;
        color: #5e5e5e;
        width: 90%;
    }

    .mexemeailcontent p {
        line-height: 26px;
        font-size: 18px;
        color: #5e5e5e;
    }

    .mexemeailbut {
        background-color: #cdcdcd;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 15px 35px;
        border-radius: 30px;
        width: max-content;
        margin: 10px 0px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 18px;
        display: block;
        color: #fff;
    }

    .mexemeailbut:hover,
    .mexemeailbut:focus {
        opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .mexemeailsocial {
        padding: 15px 35px 35px 35px;
        background-color: #e2e2e2;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailsocial h3 {
        color: #5e5e5e;
    }

    .mexemico {
        background-size: 100% !important;
        margin-right: 10px;
        overflow: hidden;
        display: block;
        float: left;
    }

    .mexemico:hover,
    .mexemico:focus {
        opacity: 0.8;
    }

    /*.mexemailfaceboock{
                    background:url(https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/emailfaceboock.png) no-repeat;
                }
                
                .mexemailinstagram{
                    background:url(https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/emailinstagram.png) no-repeat;
                }
                
                .mexemailtweeter{
                    background:url(https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/emailtweeter.png) no-repeat;
                }*/

    .mexemeailfooter {
        background-color: #003a70;
        padding: 25px 35px;
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter p {
        line-height: 26px;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #e2e2e2;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter p>a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter p>a:hover,
    .mexemeailfooter p>a:focus {
        opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .mexemeailfooter a:hover,
    .mexemeailfooter a:focus {
        opacity: 0.9;
    }
</style>

<body>
    <div style="background-color:#fff;font-family:Arial;overflow:hidden;width:100%;">
        <div style="display:flex; background-color:#fff; padding:20px 0; ">
            <p style="margin:Auto;"><img
                    src="https://www.mexinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cropped-Logo-1-2048x312.png"
                    width="225" /></p>
        </div>
        
        <div style="background-color:#fff;padding:30px;overflow:hidden;color:#5e5e5e;width:90%;"
class="mexemeailcontent">

<!--<h2 style="line-height:26px;font-size:18px;color:#5e5e5e;">Please tell us why you didnt renew.</h2>-->

            <p style="line-height:26px;font-size:18px;color:#5e5e5e;">

            <p>Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</p>
            <p>
I called you but didn't get a hold of you. I'm just following up because I think your policy has expired. I want to make sure you got our renewal notice. Sometimes, they can get lost in your email or end up in the wrong folder.</p>

<p>
If you need help, here's what you can do:
<br>
<ul><li>Call me at 619-691-7747</li>
<li>Send me a WhatsApp message at 619-488-6500</li>
<li>Send me an SMS text message at 619-691-7747</li>
</ul>
</p>
<p>Or, if you want to renew on your own, I've included a step-by-step video walkthrough that can guide you through the process.  <ul>
<li><a href="https://at.mexinsurance.com/s/article/How-to-Renew-a-Policy?language=en_US">Click here to watch the video walkthrough</a></li>
<li><a href="https://at.mexinsurance.com/login">Click here to login (your email is your user id)</a></li></ul>
</p>
<p>
Let me know if you have any questions!
</p>
<p>
--<br>
Mexico Insurance Services<br>
License 0G35864<br>
www.mexinsurance.com

          </br>

         </div>
            
             

                        </div>

                    </div>
        </div>
    
</body>

</html>